**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Local runtimes, editors, caches and build artifacts.
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.npm-cache/
**/.pip-cache/
**/*.log
**/test-output/
**/output/
*.zip
/backups/
/.agents/

